  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "20 Watch Games - Classic Pack",
      "description": "A pack of 20 mini games for you to enjoy on your Apple Watch, Apple TV or your iPhone/iPad.\n\n◉ Brick Puzzle\nDrag finger to move the bricks around. Tap to rotate and swipe down to drop.\n\n◉ Jewel Blitz\nA match 3 game style. Detonate as many gems as you can in 60s.\n\n◉ Gold Miner\nAim on the gold while the hook swings. Tap on the screen to release the hook.\n\n◉ Number Puzzle\nSwipe to combine numbers for score.\n\n◉ Sudoku (6x6)\nFill in all the empty squares without using the same number twice in each column, row, or box.\n\n◉ Bubble Shooter\nTap to shoot bubble.\n\n◉ Find Word\nWith 4 letters, you have 10s to find a word. If time runs out, you lose.\n\n◉ Color Lines\nRemove balls by forming lines (horizontal, vertical or diagonal) of at least five balls of the same color. Get the highscore!\n\n◉ Mine Sweeper\nTap to reveal a square. If a square containing a mine, you lose. Reveal all square to win.\n\n◉ Brick Breaker\nDrag your finger to move your paddle and hit the ball. Destroy all the blocks to finish levels. \n\n◉ Maze Man\nSwipe to change direction, collect all things on the map but don't touch the devil!\n\n◉ Boxing\nTap left/right to move, mid to punch..\n\n◉ Crazy Tennis\nFeel like crazy while playing with AI. Drag your finger to move your paddle. Don't let the ball out.\n\n◉ Block Ninja\nControl the ninja to avoid all spikes and get best score.\n\n◉ Tappy Bird\nTap the screen to fly up. Don't hit anything.\n\n◉ Snake\nSwipe to change snake direction.\n\n◉ Tic-Tac-Toe\nChallenge your brain with the AI.\n\n◉ Pin Hack\nFind the pin number before timeout.\n\n◉ ATM\nUse your math skill to give the right money request.\n\n◉ What Number\nFind the next number of a number chain.\n\n=> On Apple Watch please use Digital Crown to exit game.\n\nThanks for all your feedback!!!",
      "releaseNotes": "* Optimized for new OS.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/20-watch-games-classic-pack/id1108935309?uo=4",
